# CQ15 [Sensing & failures] Which sensors produce the relevant measurements, and on which component are they installed?
PREFIX optimar: <https://w3id.org/optimar#>
PREFIX sosa: <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/>
PREFIX qudt: <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/>
PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
PREFIX rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>
PREFIX owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>
SELECT ?sensor ?sensorType ?component WHERE {
  ?sensor a ?sensorType . ?sensorType rdfs:subClassOf+ optimar:Sensor .
  ?sensor optimar:isInstalledIn ?component .
} ORDER BY ?sensorType
